### 视频文案内容查询接口测试
### 作者: RayChou
### 创建时间: 2025-08-14
### 描述: 通过用户视频关联表ID查询MongoDB文案内容的API测试用例

### 1. 查询存在的文案内容
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1001
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 查询不存在的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/999999
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 查询已提取但无文案的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1002
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 查询其他用户的记录（权限测试）
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/2001
Content-Type: application/json
# 应该返回权限错误

### 5. 查询不同状态的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1003
Content-Type: application/json
# PENDING状态的记录

### 6. 查询PROCESSING状态的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1004
Content-Type: application/json
# PROCESSING状态的记录

### 7. 查询COMPLETED状态的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1005
Content-Type: application/json
# COMPLETED状态的记录

### 8. 查询FAILED状态的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1006
Content-Type: application/json
# FAILED状态的记录

### ========================================
### 边界测试
### ========================================

### 9. 查询ID为0的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/0
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. 查询负数ID
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/-1
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. 查询超大ID
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/9223372036854775807
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 权限测试场景
### ========================================

### 12. 主账号查询租户下所有记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1001
Content-Type: application/json
# 需要使用主账号token

### 13. 子账号查询自己的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/1001
Content-Type: application/json
# 需要使用子账号token，且记录属于该子账号

### 14. 子账号尝试查询其他用户的记录
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/content/2001
Content-Type: application/json
# 需要使用子账号token，但记录不属于该子账号

### ========================================
### 响应验证
### ========================================

### 期望的成功响应格式（有文案内容）：
# {
#   "code": 200,
#   "message": "success",
#   "data": {
#     "id": "64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1",
#     "videoId": "123456789",
#     "videoHash": "abc123def456",
#     "audioContent": {
#       "content": "大家好，今天教大家制作美味的家常菜...",
#       "extractMethod": "audio_to_text",
#       "extractTime": "2025-08-14 10:30:00"
#     },
#     "subtitleContent": null,
#     "ocrContent": null,
#     "createdDate": "2025-08-14 10:30:00",
#     "updateDate": "2025-08-14 10:30:00",
#     "isDeleted": 0
#   }
# }

### 期望的成功响应格式（无文案内容）：
# {
#   "code": 200,
#   "message": "success",
#   "data": null
# }

### 期望的权限错误响应格式：
# {
#   "code": 500,
#   "message": "无当前视频操作权限",
#   "data": null
# }

### 期望的记录不存在响应格式：
# {
#   "code": 500,
#   "message": "视频不存在",
#   "data": null
# }

### ========================================
### 测试数据准备
### ========================================

### 测试前需要准备的数据：
# 1. 在tb_video_user_video表中插入测试记录
# 2. 在tb_video_info表中插入对应的视频信息（包含video_hash）
# 3. 在MongoDB的video_content_extract集合中插入文案数据
# 4. 确保数据的关联关系正确

### SQL示例（MySQL）：
# INSERT INTO tb_video_user_video (id, video_id, user_id, tenant_id, source_type, video_title, source_id, extract_status, created_date, update_date, is_deleted)
# VALUES (1001, 123456789, 1001, 1, 1, '测试视频', 1001, 3, NOW(), NOW(), 0);
#
# INSERT INTO tb_video_info (id, platform_type, platform_video_id, video_hash, title, video_url, author_id, author_name, extract_status, created_date, update_date, is_deleted)
# VALUES (123456789, 4, NULL, 'abc123def456', '测试视频', 'https://example.com/video.mp4', '1001', '测试用户', 3, NOW(), NOW(), 0);

### MongoDB示例：
# db.video_content_extract.insertOne({
#   "id": "64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1",
#   "video_id": "123456789",
#   "video_hash": "abc123def456",
#   "audio_content": {
#     "content": "大家好，今天教大家制作美味的家常菜...",
#     "extract_method": "audio_to_text",
#     "extract_time": ISODate("2025-08-14T02:30:00.000Z")
#   },
#   "subtitle_content": null,
#   "ocr_content": null,
#   "created_date": ISODate("2025-08-14T02:30:00.000Z"),
#   "update_date": ISODate("2025-08-14T02:30:00.000Z"),
#   "is_deleted": 0
# });

